    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TOD Fragments: Special Fun</h2></strong><br>The events of this game revolve around the main character of the <strong>Naitras: Threads of Destiny</strong> game and his acquaintance with a mysterious lady from a brothel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will get acquainted with one of the storylines of the game Threads of Destiny;<br></li><li>8 fully animated scenes with a lot of action variations;<br></li><li>Game text: 80,000+ characters;</li></ul><br>These Fragments were previously released on RPGMakerMV, and have recently been transferred to Unity.<br><br>In Fragments, you can see examples of our work on Threads of Destiny, which includes individual character stories, animations, art, and other content that was not included in the main game when it was developed on RPGMaker MV.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.poster.avif?t=1670115000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.webm?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.mp4?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/be1dcb917904b779c47a6bc2462542cd.webp?t=1670115000\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f759959f1b790feb8ce1507db7cc8ead.poster.avif?t=1670115000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f759959f1b790feb8ce1507db7cc8ead.webm?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f759959f1b790feb8ce1507db7cc8ead.mp4?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/be1dcb917904b779c47a6bc2462542cd.webp?t=1670115000\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f83ad6f0ee1c99858ecb97f703569fb8.poster.avif?t=1670115000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f83ad6f0ee1c99858ecb97f703569fb8.webm?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f83ad6f0ee1c99858ecb97f703569fb8.mp4?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/7257b6ed77dd2fb51f3c5db612b875cf.webp?t=1670115000\" /></div><br>If you have already played TOD Fragments: Special Fun(RPGMaker MV) before, you will find hardly anything new in this version, except for optimization and various improvements.<br><br>Some time ago we started developing a fantasy game called the <strong>Naitras: Threads of Destiny</strong> as a visualization of one story that takes place somewhere on the edge of the Universe.<br><br><strong>Naitras: Threads of Destiny</strong> is currently being reworked on Unity, you can find more about it on our website.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/01339f26e04fb0a549bd