    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TOD Fragments: Special Fun</h2></strong><br>The events of this game revolve around the main character of the <strong>Naitras: Threads of Destiny</strong> game and his acquaintance with a mysterious lady from a brothel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You will get acquainted with one of the storylines of the game Threads of Destiny;<br></li><li>8 fully animated scenes with a lot of action variations;<br></li><li>Game text: 80,000+ characters;</li></ul><br>These Fragments were previously released on RPGMakerMV, and have recently been transferred to Unity.<br><br>In Fragments, you can see examples of our work on Threads of Destiny, which includes individual character stories, animations, art, and other content that was not included in the main game when it was developed on RPGMaker MV.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.poster.avif?t=1670115000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.webm?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/9f1df175d9f701bb88e853249659ee65.mp4?t=1670115000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/be1dcb917904b779c47a6bc2462542cd.webp?t=1670115000\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218440/extras/f759959f1b790feb8ce1507db7cc8ead.poster.avif?t=1670115000\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/